summary:
  A later page of the settings list that failed waits for a scroll again.

history:
  Page two of "rock" failed once at the end of the list and never came,
  because the only trigger was the list moving and a list at its end does
  not move. Both failure roads of loadMore now ask again by themselves
  through _pageFailed; this puts the error road back to waiting.

target:
  package/contents/ui/config/configSearch.qml

find:
                  } catch (e) {
                      _pageFailed()
                  }
              } else {
                  _pageFailed()
              }

replace:
                  } catch (e) {
                      _pageFailed()
                  }
              } else {
                  stat = 1
              }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_later_page_that_failed_is_asked_again_without_a_scroll.
  Line-neutral.
